{"slug":"most-dramatic-sky","prompt":"Find the single most over-the-top sky in the collections, then five runners-up. Put the winner first and tell me why it wins.","recordedAt":"2026-09-24T22:38:19.156Z","durationMs":28364,"metadata":{"startedAt":1790289470801,"engine":"claude","model":"Claude Sonnet","finishedAt":1790289499155},"parts":[{"type":"text","text":"Looking for the most theatrical, overloaded skies: apocalyptic, fiery, stormy, swirling, in any century.","at":1034},{"type":"data-step","id":"step-mug44ly6-1","data":{"kind":"search","phase":"done","startedAt":1790289472542,"terms":"apocalyptic sky","endedAt":1790289472981,"count":50,"museums":1,"unavailable":["Statens Museum for Kunst","The Met"],"items":[{"id":"aic:47582","title":"Hampstead, Stormy Sky","artist":"Style of John Constable","thumb":"https://www.artic.edu/iiif/2/02bc3896-bc28-57bd-c829-cc4de184c7a8/full/!240,240/0/default.jpg","state":"seen"},{"id":"aic:891","title":"The Cottage by the Roadside, Stormy Sky","artist":"Jules Dupré","thumb":"https://www.artic.edu/iiif/2/f4d85da1-5c80-3c7b-38cc-bf324d6ce670/full/!240,240/0/default.jpg","state":"seen"},{"id":"aic:122257","title":"The Apocalyptic Woman, from The Apocalypse","artist":"Albrecht Dürer","thumb":"https://www.artic.edu/iiif/2/12a40fa2-88de-e9c9-4738-3b03375190e0/full/!240,240/0/default.jpg","state":"seen"},{"id":"aic:63554","title":"Big River, from the Rancherie, Mendocino, California","artist":"Carleton Watkins","thumb":"https://www.artic.edu/iiif/2/0ac9663b-e17e-471d-e4e3-6c60fc800704/full/!240,240/0/default.jpg","state":"seen"},{"id":"aic:126485","title":"Cloudy Sky, Mediterranean Sea","artist":"Gustave Le Gray","thumb":"https://www.artic.edu/iiif/2/03911f46-250d-79f7-5cbb-37cfabc37c09/full/!240,240/0/default.jpg","state":"seen"}]},"at":1755,"doneAt":2190},{"type":"data-step","id":"step-mug44mal-2","data":{"kind":"search","phase":"done","startedAt":1790289472989,"terms":"storm clouds","endedAt":1790289473709,"count":63,"museums":3,"una